<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-navy dark:text-white">About Our Certificates</h1>
  <div class="gold-underline w-16 mt-2 mb-6"></div>
  <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm">
    <p>When you meet a course's completion requirements, <%= siteName %> issues you a <strong>certificate of completion</strong>. Each certificate carries a unique code and QR code that anyone can verify at our public verification page.</p>
    <p><strong>Important distinction.</strong> Our certificates recognize coursework completed at this academy. They are <strong>not</strong> government-recognized qualifications, <strong>not</strong> accredited credentials, and <strong>not</strong> official CEFR certifications. Placement levels shown in the academy (A1–C2) are internal estimates for course placement.</p>
    <p>If an employer or school needs proof of English proficiency for official purposes, we recommend an examination from a recognized testing organization.</p>
  </div>
</div>
